                </h3>
                <p className={`${schibsted_grotesk.className} text-lg`}>This procedure <span className="font-semibold">relieves pain</span> and saves a severely infected tooth by <span className="font-semibold">removing damaged tissue</span> and <span className="font-semibold">sealing it</span> from further issues.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
