                </h3>
                <p className={`${schibsted_grotesk.className} text-lg`}>We <span className="font-semibold">safely extract</span> impacted or problematic wisdom teeth to <span className="font-semibold">prevent</span> pain, crowding, and future oral healthcomplications.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

