                </h3>
                <p className={`${schibsted_grotesk.className} text-lg`}><span className="font-semibold">Custom-crafted</span> porcelain veneers can <span className="font-semibold">transform your smile</span> — correcting chips, gaps, stains, or alignment in <span className="font-semibold">just a few visits</span>.</p>
              </div>
