                </h3>
                <p className={`${schibsted_grotesk.className} text-lg`}>Crowns <span className="font-semibold">protect and restore</span> damaged teeth, while bridges <span className="font-semibold">replace</span> one or more <span className="font-semibold">missing teeth</span> — both <span className="font-semibold">restoring function</span> and <span className="font-semibold">natural appearance.</span></p>
